Package: kitems
Title: A Framework To Manage Tabular Items
Description: Provides a comprehensive framework to manage, govern, and 
    manipulate tabular data items. The package delivers an automated 
    data governance system using a human-readable YAML configuration 
    to define data schemas, attribute constraints and behaviors. 
    It features a pre-built Shiny module, an integrated administration 
    interface, and a structured set of core and grammar functions to 
    streamline data management, allowing developers to focus on user
    driven features.
Version: 0.8.1
